# EWS sshd configuration (endpoint of conduit C11: bastion -> EWS).
# Key-only, single named user; the private key never leaves the bastion volume.
Port 22
Protocol 2
PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
AllowUsers engineer
X11Forwarding no
PrintMotd no
